IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sawhs-dates`
IMPORT `sawhs-rules`
IMPORT `sawhs-seat`

-- Work Health and Safety Act 2012 (SA) -- worked cases for the worker's questions (sawhs-seat.l4) and the date helpers
-- (sawhs-dates.l4). Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited text (and regs 24, 699 and 699A of the
-- deposited Regulations); none was copied from the encoding's output. Each assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on
-- stated facts, not about the law. The facts are illustrative.
-- UNOFFICIAL. Based on content from the South Australian Legislation website at 6 November 2026 (c) State of South
-- Australia, CC BY 4.0. BASELINE ENCODING. Not for public use as advice. See NOTES.md.

§ `cases`

`d` MEANS `the calendar date`

-- "any date": a date input the answer does not read.
`any date` MEANS `d` 1 1 2026

§§ `Dates`

