#ASSERT `the date` 13 `months after` (`d` 15 12 2025) EQUALS `d` 15 1 2027
#ASSERT `the day` 14 `days after` (`d` 1 3 2026) EQUALS `d` 15 3 2026
#ASSERT `the day` 14 `days after` (`d` 20 2 2026) EQUALS `d` 6 3 2026
#ASSERT `the anniversary` 1 `years after` (`d` 29 2 2024) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2025

